# /etc/xdg/lxsession/LXDE/autostart — session autostart (runs with the
# session D-Bus up, unlike xinitrc). xscreensaver is not installed; the
# entry is harmless and left for completeness.
#
# pcmanfm --desktop is DISABLED: its desktop window renders garbage
# vertical stripes on this fbdev server in every wallpaper mode (even
# solid color). The root-window gradient from setroot (xinitrc) is the
# wallpaper instead. pcmanfm the file manager stays on the launchbar.
@lxpanel --profile LXDE
#@pcmanfm --desktop --profile LXDE
@xscreensaver -no-splash
@onboard
